  "text": "Heterozygous C2-deficiency and myasthenia gravis.\nComplement deficiency states in myasthenia gravis ( MG ) have not been reported previously . We describe a 19-year-old woman with typical MG and heterozygous C2 deficiency , along with HLA typing of the patient and her immediate family . . ",
